  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Queries the list of API products under the current tenant by using paging. You can specify the product name, type, status, category, and the published portal in the request. The response includes the product ID, name, description, status, type, documentation, icon, product category, automatic approval of subscriptions, and the MCP, agent, model, and capability configurations",
  "description_zh": "分页查询当前租户下的 API 产品列表，入参可指定产品名称、产品类型、Product 状态、产品类别与产品发布的门户，列表项返回产品 ID、名称、Product 描述、状态、类型、说明文档、图标、Product 分类、是否自动审批订阅以及 MCP/Agent/模型配置与产品能力配置",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun apig list-products --page-size 10 --page-number 1 --name weather-query-api --type API --portal-id portal-xxxxxxxx --status Published --next-token next-token-xxxxxxxx --max-results 10 --category-ids category-xxxxxxxx --region cn-hangzhou",
